---
interface Props {
  kind: 'slope' | 'area';
}
const { kind } = Astro.props;
const slope = kind === 'slope';
---

<figure class="calculus-graph">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 420 320" role="img" aria-label={slope
    ? 'Position equals time squared. At two seconds, the tangent slope is four metres per second; the secant to three seconds has slope five.'
    : 'Velocity rises linearly from zero to six metres per second in three seconds. Left-endpoint rectangles total six metres; the triangular area under the line is nine metres.'}>
    <path d="M70 35V250H390" class="axis" />
    <text x="70" y="22">{slope ? 'Position (m)' : 'Velocity (m/s)'}</text>
    <text x="230" y="299">Time (s)</text>
    <g class="ticks">
      <text x="58" y="273">0</text>
      <text x="165" y="273">1</text>
      <text x="265" y="273">2</text>
      <text x="365" y="273">3</text>
      <text x="43" y="254">0</text>
      <text x="43" y="184">{slope ? '3' : '2'}</text>
      <text x="43" y="114">{slope ? '6' : '4'}</text>
      <text x="43" y="44">{slope ? '9' : '6'}</text>
    </g>
    <path d="M65 180H75M65 110H75M65 40H75M170 245V255M270 245V255M370 245V255" class="axis" />
    {slope ? (
      <>
        <path d="M70 250Q220 250 370 40" class="curve" />
        <path d="M170 250L370 63.333" class="tangent" />
        <path d="M270 156.667L370 40" class="secant" />
        <circle cx="270" cy="156.667" r="5" />
        <circle cx="370" cy="40" r="5" />
        <text x="85" y="62">Solid curve: position</text>
        <text x="85" y="85">Dashed: secant</text>
        <text x="85" y="108">Dotted: tangent</text>
      </>
    ) : (
      <>
        <path d="M70 250L370 40V250Z" class="area" />
        <path d="M170 250V180H270V250M270 250V110H370V250" class="rectangles" />
        <path d="M70 250L370 40" class="curve" />
        <text x="85" y="62">Solid line: velocity</text>
        <text x="85" y="85">Boxes: left samples</text>
      </>
    )}
  </svg>
  <figcaption>{slope
    ? 'A tangent describes the local slope. A secant describes an average over an interval.'
    : 'Each box uses the velocity at the start of its interval. The first box has zero height.'}</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .calculus-graph { max-width: 36rem; margin: 1.5rem auto; }
  svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; color: inherit; }
  text { fill: currentColor; font-family: 'Fira Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; }
  .ticks { font-family: 'Fira Math', math; }
  .ticks text { font-family: inherit; }
  circle { fill: currentColor; }
  .axis { fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .curve { fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 2.5; }
  .tangent { fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 2; stroke-dasharray: 2 4; }
  .secant { fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 2; stroke-dasharray: 8 5; }
  .area { fill: currentColor; opacity: 0.06; }
  .rectangles { fill: currentColor; fill-opacity: 0.12; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.5; }
  figcaption { font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.5; }
</style>
